        "original_id": "1d7f7860-baa2-5f1d-9eb2-789a8b3cf365",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Peter Asher, Esperanza Spalding, Sara Watkins, Waddy Wachtel, Carmen Cusack\n- Products: Love Has Come for You, Bright Star, Wicked\n- Roles: record producer, guitarist, singer, manager, actor roles\n\nFacts:\n- Peter Asher was born on 22 June 1944 and is a British guitarist, singer, manager, and record producer.\n- The 2013 bluegrass album Love Has Come for You was produced by Peter Asher.\n- Love Has Come for You features musical appearances by Esperanza Spalding, Sara Watkins, Waddy Wachtel, and others.\n- The musical Bright Star was inspired by a Grammy-winning collaboration on the 2013 bluegrass album Love Has Come for You.\n- Carmen Cusack originated the role of Alice Murphy in the Broadway musical Bright Star.\n- Carmen Cusack is also known for playing Elphaba in the Chicago, North American Tour, and Melbourne productions of Wicked.",
